    <title>安装流程</title>
    <conbody>
        <codeblock id="codeblock_pds_ghb_tkc"> # 示例：设备初始化命令
    thermo-cli init -- mode auto</codeblock>
        <p>步骤说明：</p>
        <ol id="ol_ghz_lhb_tkc">
